  "dek": "A major score jump lifts Nader into the chasing field; Muggle stays fourteenth while Kajetan Schweighofer improves and still falls short of gold.",
  "discord": "The ARC Daily Digest · Late edition — ARC-AGI-2\nYoussef Nader reaches 21st at 51.11. Gold gets harder to hold: Kajetan Schweighofer improves but remains just outside; Muggle holds fourteenth and masspeaks slips to seventeenth. Tufa Labs still leads.\nhttps://arc.markbarney.net/news/2026-10-16-evening-arc-2",
